    [2902]={name="Cloak of the Faith",quality=2,ilvl=30,reqLevel=23,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Worgen in the Woods'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Calor in Duskwood. Objective: Bring Calor's note to Jonathan Carevin.",zone="Duskwood",questName="Worgen in the Woods",lore="Here you go. Bring this message to Master Carevin. A few more like you, and we will outnumber the Night Watch! Perhaps then we could complete the work that we few carry on today."},
    [2907]={name="Dwarven Tree Chopper",quality=2,ilvl=20,reqLevel=16,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'A Dark Threat Looms'. Pick it over the other reward choices. The quest is in Loch Modan. Objective: The Disarming Mixture seemed to take effect.  Return to Chief Engineer Hinderweir to report the good news.",zone="Loch Modan",questName="A Dark Threat Looms",lore="The keg fizzles slightly.",proc="Equip: Reduces chance to be Dodged or Parried by 0.6%."},
    [2910]={name="Gold Militia Boots",quality=2,ilvl=25,reqLevel=15,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Howling in the Hills'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Verner Osgood in Redridge Mountains. Objective: Bring Yowler's Paw to Verner Osgood in Lakeshire.",zone="Redridge Mountains",questName="Howling in the Hills",lore="the gnolls are still out there. I can hear their baying as they hunt in the hills above Lakeshire. And one cry is louder than the rest - Yowler, their leader."},
    [2911]={name="Keller's Girdle",quality=3,ilvl=23,reqLevel=18,sourceType="world_drop",instructions="World drop around level 16-26.",zone="The Barrens",zoneOpen=true},
    [2912]={name="Claw of the Shadowmancer",quality=3,ilvl=32,reqLevel=27,sourceType="world_drop",instructions="World drop around level 26-34.",zone="Stranglethorn Vale"},
    [2913]={name="Silk Mantle of Gamn",quality=2,ilvl=28,reqLevel=22,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Uncovering the Past'.",zone="Wetlands",questName="Uncovering the Past",lore="Just before the invasion I uncovered a large tablet called the Goaz Stone. The translated text breaks off in 4 places. The text speaks of a \"divine plan\" and a \"doomed prophecy.\" I fear we are running out of time."},
    [2916]={name="Gold Lion Shield",quality=2,ilvl=34,reqLevel=26,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'A Grim Task'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Longbraid the Grim in Wetlands. Objective: Kill Balgaras the Foul and bring his ear to Longbraid the Grim outside of Dun Modr.",zone="Wetlands",questName="A Grim Task",lore="Many of my soldiers died in the battle of Dun Modr. My own brother perished when the West Bridge over the Thandol Span was destroyed. Aye, the Dark Iron dwarves are a devilish breed."},
    [2933]={name="Seal of Wrynn",quality=3,ilvl=31,reqLevel=16,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'An Audience with the King'. Starts with Baros Alexston in Stormwind City. Objective: Deliver Baros Alexston's report on the Defias Brotherhood to King Varian Wrynn in Stormwind Keep.",zone="Stormwind City",questName="An Audience with the King",lore="I have prepared a report for the King. I believe you should be the one to deliver it to him, along with an account of your findings. Do not worry, there is no doubt that he will commend you for doing your duty to the people of Stormwind."},
    [2941]={name="Prison Shank",quality=3,ilvl=28,reqLevel=23,sourceType="rare_npc",instructions="Drops from Bruegal Ironknuckle.",zone="The Stockade",npc="Bruegal Ironknuckle"},
    [2942]={name="Iron Knuckles",quality=3,ilvl=28,reqLevel=23,sourceType="rare_npc",instructions="Drops from Bruegal Ironknuckle.",zone="The Stockade",npc="Bruegal Ironknuckle"},
    [2943]={name="Eye of Paleth",quality=2,ilvl=31,reqLevel=22,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Cleansing the Eye'. Starts with Glorin Steelbrow in Stormwind City. Objective: Bring Archbishop Benedictus the Cursed Eye of Paleth. Benedictus is in the Cathedral of Light, in the city of Stormwind.",zone="Wetlands",questName="Cleansing the Eye",lore="I can't lift the curse from the Eye of Paleth."},
    [2949]={name="Mariner Boots",quality=2,ilvl=25,reqLevel=20,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Return the Statuette'. Pick it over the other reward choices. The quest is in Wetlands. Objective: Bring Karl Boran the Menethil Statuette.",zone="Wetlands",questName="Return the Statuette",lore="After pulling the barrel free from the muck and opening it, a silvery figurine is found packed in fine straw. It depicts a young, long-haired Paladin with hammer upraised."},
    [2951]={name="Ring of the Underwood",quality=3,ilvl=36,reqLevel=31,sourceType="world_drop",instructions="World drop around level 32-38.",zone="Stranglethorn Vale"},
    [2953]={name="Watch Master's Cloak",quality=2,ilvl=33,reqLevel=20,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Morbent Fel'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Sven Yorgen in Duskwood. Objective: Use Morbent's Bane on Morbent Fel, kill Morbent Fel, then return Morbent's Bane to Sven at his camp.",zone="Duskwood",questName="Morbent Fel",lore="Morbent Fel hides in his lair, the house perched atop the hill to the east overlooking the Raven Hill cemetery. His time in this land is drawing to an end..."},
