    [19116]={name="Greenleaf Handwraps",quality=2,ilvl=50,reqLevel=46,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Separation Anxiety'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Huntsman Markhor in The Hinterlands. Objective: Huntsman Markhor at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands wants you to recover his twin brother's remains. Find and return Huntsman Malkhor's Skull and Huntsman Malkhor's Bones to Huntsman Markhor.Markhor mentioned that his brother's remains were fed to the oozes and wolves of the Vilebranch. He also mentioned that there is a refuse pit filled with oozes in Jintha'alor as well as a wolf den. Both of these places are near the top of the temple.",zone="The Hinterlands",questName="Separation Anxiety",lore="Like many in our village, I too have lost a loved one to the wilds. Alas, it was my twin brother Malkhor - taken in the same raid as Torntusk's mate by the Vilebranch."},
    [19119]={name="Owlbeast Hide Gloves",quality=2,ilvl=50,reqLevel=44,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Final Message to the Wildhammer'. Starts with Otho Moji'ko in The Hinterlands. Objective: Otho Moji'ko at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands wants you to travel to Aerie Peak in the western region of the Hinterlands and place the Final Message to the Wildhammer by the well in the center of town. Return to him once this task is complete.Beware of angry Wildhammer dwarves and unruly members of the Alliance.",zone="The Hinterlands",questName="The Final Message to the Wildhammer",lore="You take this, mon. You take this to Aerie Peak, dead center of town by the well. You plant it! Drive it right into the ground! Show those dwarves that troll mean business!"},
    [19120]={name="Rune of the Guard Captain",quality=2,ilvl=51,reqLevel=46,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Job Opening: Guard Captain of Revantusk Village'. The quest is in The Hinterlands. Objective: You have been tasked with the decimation of 20 Vilebranch Berserkers, 20 Vilebranch Shadow Hunters, 20 Vilebranch Blood Drinkers, and 20 Vilebranch Soul Eaters.Should you complete this task, return to Primal Torntusk at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands.",zone="The Hinterlands",questName="Job Opening: Guard Captain of Revantusk Village",lore="With the loss of Guard Captain Malkhor, the position of Guard Captain of Revantusk is once again open.",proc="Equip: Improves your chance to hit by 0.7%."},
    [19121]={name="Deep Woodlands Cloak",quality=3,ilvl=51,reqLevel=46,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Wanted: Vile Priestess Hexx and Her Minions'. Pick it over the other reward choices. The quest is in The Hinterlands. Objective: You have been ordered to slay Vile Priestess Hexx and 20 Vilebranch Aman'zasi Guards. See Primal Torntusk at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands once this task is complete.Vile Priestess Hexx and the Aman'zasi Guards can be found atop Jintha'alor in the Hinterlands.",zone="The Hinterlands",questName="Wanted: Vile Priestess Hexx and Her Minions",lore="By order of Primal Torntusk, Vile Priestess Hexx and her minions are to be brought to justice! A grand reward is offered for any that slay the Vile Priestess Hexx and all of her Aman'zasi elite guard."},
    [19123]={name="Everwarm Handwraps",quality=2,ilvl=48,reqLevel=45,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'STOLEN: Smithing Tuyere and Lookout's Spyglass'. Pick it over the other reward choices. The quest is in Searing Gorge. Objective: Find and return the Smithing Tuyere and Lookout's Spyglass to Taskmaster Scrange in the Searing Gorge.The only information you have about these items is the following: They were definitely stolen by Dark Iron dwarves. The Smithing Tuyere is a blacksmithing tool used by blacksmiths and the Lookout's Spyglass is an invaluable monitoring tool to lookouts.",zone="Searing Gorge",questName="STOLEN: Smithing Tuyere and Lookout's Spyglass",lore="The following items have been stolen: *One Dark Iron Tuyere. *One Lookout's Spyglass. A reward is being offered to individuals who find and return these pilfered items."},
    [19125]={name="Seared Mail Girdle",quality=2,ilvl=49,reqLevel=45,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Fiery Menace!'. Starts with Hansel Heavyhands in Searing Gorge. Objective: Hansel Heavyhands wants you to kill 20 Greater Lava Spiders in the Searing Gorge. You can find Greater Lava Spiders in the plateaus and lava pools of the Searing Gorge.Return to Hansel Heavyhands in the Searing Gorge when you have killed enough Greater Lava Spiders.",zone="Searing Gorge",questName="Fiery Menace!",lore="Wouldn't ye know it, every time ol' Hansel wants to take a moment to relax and reflect upon his life, the powers that be give him another job."},
    [19127]={name="Charred Leather Tunic",quality=2,ilvl=50,reqLevel=45,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'WANTED: Overseer Maltorius'. Pick it over the other reward choices. The quest is in Searing Gorge. Objective: Deep within the Slag Pit of the Cauldron, in the Searing Gorge, you will find the traitorous Dark Iron dwarf named Overseer Maltorius.Slay Overseer Maltorius and take his head. Return the head to Lookout Captain Lolo Longstriker in the Searing Gorge for your reward.",zone="Searing Gorge",questName="WANTED: Overseer Maltorius",lore="By order o' 'is eminence, Overseer Oilfist, the rogue Thorium Brotherhood agent an' newly hired commander o' the Dark Iron Slag Pit crew o' the Cauldron, Overseer Maltorius, is to be killed an' 'is head brung back as proof o' the deed."},
    [19128]={name="Seared Mail Vest",quality=2,ilvl=50,reqLevel=45,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'WANTED: Overseer Maltorius'. Pick it over the other reward choices. The quest is in Searing Gorge. Objective: Deep within the Slag Pit of the Cauldron, in the Searing Gorge, you will find the traitorous Dark Iron dwarf named Overseer Maltorius.Slay Overseer Maltorius and take his head. Return the head to Lookout Captain Lolo Longstriker in the Searing Gorge for your reward.",zone="Searing Gorge",questName="WANTED: Overseer Maltorius",lore="By order o' 'is eminence, Overseer Oilfist, the rogue Thorium Brotherhood agent an' newly hired commander o' the Dark Iron Slag Pit crew o' the Cauldron, Overseer Maltorius, is to be killed an' 'is head brung back as proof o' the deed."},
